<html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>SubFuse Beta 0.14</title>
<h2>A dark look for Saved usage</h2>
<p>All three macOS widget sizes now share the dashboard’s Fuse mark, charcoal surfaces, provider icons, and violet allowance bars. The small widget gives a single current reading more room. Expired or unavailable readings have a dashed track.</p>
<p>To add a widget, Control-click the desktop, choose <strong>Edit Widgets</strong>, search for <strong>SubFuse</strong>, and add <strong>Saved usage</strong>.</p>
</html>
